
~ start

if GameState.has_item("Stool")
	PLUM: Okay moment of truth. (worried)
	PLUM: There's a hole behind the painting. (suprised)
	VINCENT: What? (suprised)
	VINCENT: Can you get in? 
	PLUM: It's pretty big, I think we both can. 
	VINCENT: I'll go first. Stay behind me okay? (serious)
	PLUM: Can I get a "I was right?" (silly)
	VINCENT: You got lucky.
	A few minutes pass.
	PLUM: This feels like it'd never end (tired)
	PLUM: Oof. (suprised)
	VINCENT: Are you okay? (worried)
	PLUM: Yup!
	[scene=main_hall]  
	=> END

else
	PLUM: Who hangs up an empty picture (thinking)
	PLUM: Maybe there's something behind the frame. (thinking)
	VINCENT: What a stupid idea. (angry)
	PLUM: Mean! (sad)
	=> END
